<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:tdn="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:">
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="association-001">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom" />
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:administers" />
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-red-aw" />
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-inner-encryption" />
    <tdn:basis>source_stated</tdn:basis>
    <tdn:qualification>Annotation of the source assignment; no universal or existential property restriction is asserted.</tdn:qualification>
    <tdn:qualification>The target can comprise multiple deployed components. Presence and management exclusions remain in the source requirements.</tdn:qualification>
    <tdn:rationale>The source assigns maintenance, monitoring, and security control of the named target to the Red AW.</tdn:rationale>
    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p026:u002.s001" />
  </rdf:Description>
