    <tdn:leanExpression>EncapsulationUse</tdn:leanExpression>
    <tdn:leanMapping>The encapsulation role uses EncapsulationUse records and the standaloneEncapsulator predicate. A device kind is available, while the actual specification checks the selected use, attachments and applicable duties.</tdn:leanMapping>
