    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p049:u013" />
    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p060:u009.s001" />
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31-013: The Gray path specification distinguishes Inner components, Gray Firewalls, workstations, locally run CAs, all CAs and revocation services. Gray AWs and locally run CAs follow the highest-level convention. The broader service-path requirements retain each service’s actual level.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31R-033: Mandatory MTU bounds include Inner Gray interfaces, Outer Black interfaces and applicable Gray Firewall external interfaces. The separate Inner fragmentation-reduction objective remains optional.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
  </rdf:Description>
