    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-055" />
    <tdn:leanExpression>Device.kind = .innerFirewall</tdn:leanExpression>
    <tdn:leanMapping>The firewall’s architectural role has a dedicated device kind. Actual filtering comes from the deployment’s policy and processing records.</tdn:leanMapping>
