    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p025:u007.s001" />
    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p042:u004" />
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31-007: V3.1 separates encryption mechanism, Inner/Outer layer, interface zone and full security level. Flow.Valid binds the two tunnel endpoints and independent key contexts. AuthenticationServices requires a CA or key-generation service according to each component’s selected authentication method. Workstations are optional under the current scope.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31R-033: Mandatory MTU bounds include Inner Gray interfaces, Outer Black interfaces and applicable Gray Firewall external interfaces. The separate Inner fragmentation-reduction objective remains optional.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
  </rdf:Description>
