    <tdn:supports_certificate_provisioning rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-outer-vpn" />
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31-012: Credential separation applies to the selected certificate or shared-key method. Management-device presence and separation are required only when managementSelected is true. Different network names do not imply different full security levels.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
