    <tdn:leanExpression>Device.layer = some .outer</tdn:leanExpression>
    <tdn:leanMapping>The encryption layer identifies the component’s position in the protection sequence. Its mechanism remains a separate device kind. Its Black-facing interfaces appear in the packet-size inventory with the encryption external role.</tdn:leanMapping>
