  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-trust-anchor-ca">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" />
    <rdfs:comment>CA whose certificate is installed as the trust anchor under MSC-VG-4; Root CA remains a separately preserved example rather than an exact alias.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>Trust Anchor CA</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-ca" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-007" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-017" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-020" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-024" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-048" />
    <tdn:associatedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-067" />
    <tdn:directRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-020" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-007" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-017" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-020" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-024" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-048" />
    <tdn:inheritedRequirement rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:RG-067" />
    <tdn:leanExpression>InnerAuthentication.credential</tdn:leanExpression>
    <tdn:leanExpression>InnerCredential.certificate</tdn:leanExpression>
    <tdn:leanMapping>The authentication model records certificate issuers and trusted issuer identifiers. It does not encode the full CA hierarchy or every distinction among these source roles.</tdn:leanMapping>
    <tdn:leanReference>DeviceKind at TDN/Requirements/MscComplianceSchema.lean:11</tdn:leanReference>
    <tdn:leanReference>InnerAuthentication at TDN/Requirements/CrossEnclavePkiIsolationSpec.lean:11</tdn:leanReference>
    <tdn:leanRepresentation>context</tdn:leanRepresentation>
    <tdn:roleId>ROLE-trust-anchor-ca</tdn:roleId>
    <tdn:roleKind>device_or_service_role</tdn:roleKind>
    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p038:u009" />
    <tdn:theoryInterpretation>V31-012: Credential separation applies to the selected certificate or shared-key method. Management-device presence and separation are required only when managementSelected is true. Different network names do not imply different full security levels.</tdn:theoryInterpretation>
  </rdf:Description>
